::  name       tally fold pair-sum gate
::  shape      pair-shape -> sum - int (@u32)
::  invariant  folds the two pair fields into one @u32 by wrapping add; empty pair 0 0 answers 0
::  example    3 5 -> 8 · 0 0 -> 0
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend a2 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-a2-tally-fold2-v0 · STOA333 landed: list fold over a closed pair (e244)
::
::  Ashvini a2 · gate two — the first fold over a *list shape*, not a virtual range.
::  Mantra's weave is a fold over a sequence; this is that shape spoken in Glow Tend.
|=  xs=pair-shape
|+  sum  xs
